<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-14219] stopAllGrids does not wait for IgniteProcessProxy stop.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-14219</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;stopAllGrids does not wait for subprocess stops. In case of running grids in subprocess (IgniteProcessProxy). It just wait for &quot;kill -9&quot; command, but it&apos;s performed async. So subprocess with grid may be running for more time and&#160;interfere with other tests.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
